<title>SINGAPORE: Intraco, Teledata in mobile radio venture.</title>
<headline>Intraco, Teledata in mobile radio venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intraco Ltd and Teledata (S) Ltd said on Thursday they had been appointed the infrastructure provider for radio coverage for the mobile radio operators on a new mass rapid transit line.</p>
<p>The companies said in a joint statement the authorisation was given by the Telecommunication Authority of Singapore to Hutchison IntraPage Pte Ltd, a joint venture between Hutchison Telecommunications (S) Ltd, Intraco and Teledata.</p>
<p>The joint venture company is one of three new operators to start radio public paging services on April 1.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
